@param {object} options - The configuration object for the transformation.
@param {object} options.form - The form object containing the data to validate.
@param {Array<object>} options.requiredFieldsConfig - An array of objects defining the validation rules.
@param {object} [options.context={}] - An optional context object providing any external functions or data needed by the condition functions.
@returns {string|null} A formatted string of missing fields, or null if all required fields are present.
